{"text": "West Coast Chemical\n\nCorporation\n\nWC4216\n\nDescription:\nSuperior to conventional Guard products all new\ntechnology providing improved surface wear performance\nwith exceptional gloss and safety standards for polish hard\nsurfaces including granite stone & concrete\n\nIntended Use:\nNew advanced chemical technology to protect polish\nconcrete from chemical stains superior gloss and\nresistance to abrasion from heavy traffic conditions\n\nProduct Features:\n\n\u00a9 Durability... eee eee Exceptional\n\u00a2 Water/Detergent Resistance.\ne Leveling...\n\nPhysical Properties:\n\u00b0 Solids.\n\ne Viscosity ,cps....\n\u00a2 Specific Gravity.\ne Weight/Gallon(LBS).\ne Appearance .. Off-White Emulsion\n\u00a2 Freeze/Thaw Stability.... Do Not Freeze\n\nLimitations of Use:\nCommercial Use Only\n\nCustomer Service:\nCall or Visit West Coast Chemical\nToll Free: 1.800.223.0526\nE-mail: westcoastchemical@yahoo.com\n\nWestCoast chemical $e CORPORATE OFFICE \u00a2 P.O. Box 4572 \u00a2 Fresno, CA. 93744\nToll: 1.800.223.0526 \u00a2 Phone: 1.559.275.2293 \u00a2 Fax: 1.559.275.0122\n\nTECHNICAL DATA SHEET\n\nSurface Preparation:\nPrior to applying this product remove all previous materials\nand surface soil rinse thoroughly with clear water an dallow\nthe surface to dry\n\nMixing Instructions:\nNo mixing is required\n\nApplication Instructions:\nApply with a clean microfiber pad pour the guard on the\nsurface and apply a thin even coat allow for adequate time\nfor the coat to dry. a second coat is recommended for\noptimal performance, it is also recommended to burnish\nafter the second coat is dry\n\nNote:\nWC4216 Guard coverage is approximately 3500 SQFT per\ngallon on polish concrete surface\n\nStorage:\nDo not store above 100F also protect from freezing\n\nCompliances:\nCarb compliant less than 1% VOC\n\nChemical Resistance:\nResults after one hour dry time of the following chemicals\n\nVinegar......... 10\nPhosphoric Acid.............. 10\n\nScale Rating = 1-10 Worse - 10 Best\n\neooceee\nuv\nre}\nx\noO\nw\n=a.\nSa\n\u00ae\nan\noO\n\nPrecautions:\nPlease refer to the appropriate material safety\ndata sheet (MSDS) prior to using this product.\nFor technical assistance, please call 1.800.223.0526\nFOR INDUSTRIAL / PROFESSIONAL USE ONLY\n\nKEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN\n\nwww.westcoastchemical.com",
